  {
   "id": "bloodhound-195382@major-2023-12-31",
   "gameId": "bloodhound-195382",
   "displayName": "Bloodhound Update: Optimize FPS, 50% Off - Dive into Demonic Adventures!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-31T15:49:19.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello again Demon Hunters! o/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We humbly apologize for the recent lapse in communication through Steam. Sadly, health hurdles momentarily hindered our updates. However, fear not! Our plucky indie team has been relentlessly toiling away behind the scenes to amplify our game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As we battled our own demons (not the exhilarating kind we pursue in-game!), we remained steadfast in refining our creation to deliver an even more gripping experience. Anticipate updates on our ongoing demon-hunting escapades! 🎮👾💥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your unwavering support and patience are invaluable as we continue our quest for gaming greatness! 🌟💪",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These verses carry our New Year wishes to you, Demon Hunters! 🎉🌟",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the New Year, seek demons’ might, 🔍👾",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hunt them down with skill and sight. 🎯✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "May your victories be grand, battles bold, 🏆🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A year of gaming thrills, yet untold! 🎮🌟",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wishing hunts of demons, great and grand, 🌌🎮",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A New Year filled with triumphs firsthand! 🎉💪",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Action-packed days, victories bright, 🌟🎉",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "May the New Year bring gaming delight! 🎮✨\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In our forthcoming update, get ready to witness significant enhancements and optimizations that will elevate your gaming experience to new heights:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are actively working on improving optimization through DLSS for Nvidia 20+ series cards and FSR for AMD cards. This optimization extends to Nvidia 10+ series cards as well, significantly boosting FPS by 50% to even 150%, depending on the player's hardware setup. FSR also functions seamlessly on Nvidia 10+ series cards, providing enhanced performance for a broader range of players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Introducing DLSS support exclusively for Nvidia 20+ series graphics cards, ensuring smoother and more immersive visuals for supported hardware. 🖥️✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Embrace the power of FSR, available for both AMD and Nvidia 10+ graphics cards, unlocking a substantial FPS boost of 50% to 150% across various hardware configurations. 🚀🎮",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Experience minor AI improvements, enhancing the game's overall intelligence for more engaging encounters. 🤖🔧",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've also dedicated efforts to resolve minor environmental bugs, ensuring a seamless and polished gameplay environment. 🌍🐛",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prepare for these improvements and stay tuned for an update that's geared towards maximizing performance and delivering a more refined gameplay experience! 🎮✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Announcing a 50% discount on our game until January 6, 2024! Join the demon-hunting action at an unbeatable price. 🎮👾💥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And that's not all! Stay tuned for a discounted price during the upcoming FPS Steam Fest. Don't miss out on another chance to grab Bloodhound at a great price! 🎉🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for standing by us! Dive into the game fearlessly and take on every challenge with confidence! 🙌💫",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Check out our FREE DLC",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "\"Bring the Bloodhound world fully into the retro dimension 🕹️ and enjoy juicy old-style gameplay! o7. 🎉 Dive in and embrace the challenge! 🎮🔥\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Join us and let the demonic adventures begin! 🎮🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bloodhound Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From Players for Players! o7",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
