       "text": "VFX Pooling Repair: Enemie's VFX projectiles do not stay where they hit and do not create a landmine effect.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improving the soket in rocket launcher. Missiles do not stop in the air or explode on the player.: Thank you for your support and help in finding bugs. o7",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
